  {
   "zone": {
    "x0": 11475,
    "z0": 1700,
    "x1": 12835,
    "z1": 3910
   },
   "text": "A calendar from a supply company. July 1998.\nSomeone circled three days in red: the 17th, the 31st, the 8th.\nAnd wrote them again at the bottom. 17 31 8."
  },
  {
   "zone": {
    "x0": 12920,
    "z0": 3910,
    "x1": 16150,
    "z1": 4760
   },
   "text": "He died in his bed. Nobody even pulled the blanket over his face."
  },
  {
   "zone": {
    "x0": 15640,
    "z0": 6970,
    "x1": 18700,
    "z1": 7905
   },
   "text": "They tied him to the bunk with their belts.\nWrists and ankles. Then something with a hammer."
  },
  {
   "zone": {
    "x0": 12920,
    "z0": 7565,
    "x1": 14620,
    "z1": 8670
   },
   "text": "A diary, left open on the bunk.\n\"Mike's fever broke at 3. He doesn't know us.\""
  },
  {
   "zone": {
    "x0": 7480,
    "z0": 5100,
    "x1": 9860,
    "z1": 6970
   },
   "text": "A card game nobody finished. Bottles, all empty."
  },
  {
   "zone": {
    "x0": 11730,
    "z0": 6290,
    "x1": 13940,
    "z1": 8160
   },
   "text": "A footlocker and a chair, shoved back from the door.\nThey were holding it shut."
  },
  {
   "zone": {
    "x0": 9860,
    "z0": 3145,
    "x1": 11900,
    "z1": 4080
   },
   "text": "The stove's cold."
  },
  {
   "zone": {
    "x0": 2210,
    "z0": 3910,
    "x1": 4760,
    "z1": 4760
   },
   "text": "His footlocker, open. Letters from home. A photo of a woman."
  }
 ],
